      "purpose": "ILE RPG module providing a wrapper around the PASE curl command-line tool. It exposes two procedures: il_curl, which builds and executes a curl shell command via QP2SHELL writing output/error to IFS temp files, then reads and returns the response; and loadFromStream, which reads a stream file from IFS into a varchar string using C runtime fopen/fread/fclose. Uses EXTPROC for Qp0zLprintf (job log) and EXTPGM for QP2SHELL, and includes the ILEcurl copybook for additional prototypes (fopen, fread, fclose, unlink, loadFromStream).",
